    "title": "Fort Cobb Man Injured in Highway 9 Collision - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago Caddo County, OK – A 75-year-old Fort Cobb man was injured Tuesday afternoon, October 20, following a two-vehicle collision on Highway 9 in Caddo County. According to the Oklahoma Highway Patrol, the crash occurred at approximately 3:44 p.m., about 4.7 miles south of Fort Cobb, near County Road 2580. Read full article\n1",
